### ============================================
### TEST ĐĂNG NHẬP - ĐÃ SỬA LỖI
### ============================================
### 
### ✅ TẤT CẢ PASSWORDS ĐÃ ĐƯỢC RESET
### ✅ Tất cả users có password: admin123
### ✅ Hash method: pbkdf2:sha256
### 
### ============================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### ============================================
### TEST 1: ĐĂNG NHẬP SAMPLE USERS
### ============================================

### 1.1. Login as SUPER_ADMIN
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

# Expected: 200 OK + token + roles: ["SUPER_ADMIN"]

###

### 1.2. Login as HR_MANAGER
# @name loginHR
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "hr_manager",
  "password": "admin123"
}

# Expected: 200 OK + token + roles: ["HR_MANAGER"]

###

### 1.3. Login as PAYROLL_ACCOUNTANT
# @name loginAccountant
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "accountant",
  "password": "admin123"
}

# Expected: 200 OK + token + roles: ["PAYROLL_ACCOUNTANT"]

###

### 1.4. Login as EMPLOYEE
# @name loginEmployee
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "employee",
  "password": "admin123"
}

# Expected: 200 OK + token + roles: ["EMPLOYEE"]

###

