### ============================================
### TEST 3: PASTE TOKEN VÀO ĐÂY
### ============================================

@adminToken = PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
@hrToken = PASTE_HR_TOKEN_HERE

### ============================================
### TEST 4: GET CURRENT USER INFO
### ============================================

### 4.1. Get admin info
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

# Expected: 200 OK + user data with roles

###

### 4.2. Get HR manager info
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{hrToken}}

# Expected: 200 OK + user data with roles

###

### ============================================
### TEST 5: TEST SAI PASSWORD
### ============================================

### 5.1. Login với password sai
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

# Expected: 401 Unauthorized

###

### ============================================
### TEST 6: TEST USER KHÔNG TỒN TẠI
### ============================================

### 6.1. Login với username không tồn tại
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "nonexistent",
  "password": "admin123"
}

# Expected: 401 Unauthorized

###

### ============================================
### TEST 7: ĐĂNG KÝ USER MỚI
### ============================================

### 7.1. Register new user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newuser2",
  "email": "newuser2@company.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "phone": "0987654321",
  "dob": "1995-05-15",
  "gender": "Nam"
}

# Expected: 201 Created

###

### 7.2. Login với user vừa tạo
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newuser2",
  "password": "password123"
}

# Expected: 200 OK + token

###

### ============================================
### TEST 8: CREATE USER WITH ROLES (SUPER_ADMIN ONLY)
### ============================================

### 8.1. ✅ ADMIN tạo user với roles (Should SUCCESS)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "username": "newhr2",
  "email": "newhr2@company.com",
  "password": "hr123",
  "phone": "0912345678",
  "roleIds": [2]
}

# Expected: 201 Created

###

### 8.2. ❌ HR_MANAGER tạo user (Should FAIL - 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{hrToken}}

{
  "username": "failuser",
  "email": "fail@company.com",
  "password": "fail123",
  "roleIds": [4]
}

# Expected: 403 Forbidden

###

