### SUMMARY - TÓM TẮT
### ============================================

# ✅ TẤT CẢ 8 USERS ĐÃ ĐƯỢC RESET:
#
# 1. admin / admin123 → SUPER_ADMIN
# 2. hr_manager / admin123 → HR_MANAGER
# 3. accountant / admin123 → PAYROLL_ACCOUNTANT
# 4. employee / admin123 → EMPLOYEE
# 5. testuser_updated / admin123
# 6. newuser / admin123
# 7. sang / admin123
# 8. testuser / admin123
#
# ✅ Hash method: pbkdf2:sha256
